1
00:06:09,473 --> 00:06:15,473
Some secrets take us to the edge.

2
00:12:18,947 --> 00:12:24,947
Edge of Darkness is a crime, drama, mystery film directed by Martin Campbell.

3
00:18:28,421 --> 00:18:34,421
As a seasoned homicide detective, Thomas Craven has
seen the bleakest side of humanity.

4
00:24:37,894 --> 00:24:43,894
But nothing prepares him for the toughest investigation of his
life: the search for his only daughter Emma's killer.

5
00:30:47,368 --> 00:30:53,368
Now, he is on a personal mission to uncover the disturbing secrets surrounding her murder,
including corporate corruption, government collusion and Emma's own mysterious life.

6
00:36:56,842 --> 00:37:02,842
Craven, played by Mel Gibson.

7
00:43:06,315 --> 00:43:12,315
Jedburgh, played by Ray Winstone.

8
00:49:15,789 --> 00:49:21,789
Jack Bennett, played by Danny Huston.

9
00:55:25,263 --> 00:55:31,263
Emma Craven, played by Bojana Novaković.

10
01:01:34,736 --> 01:01:40,736
Burnham, played by Shawn Roberts.

11
01:07:44,210 --> 01:07:50,210
Millroy, played by David Aaron Baker.

12
01:13:53,684 --> 01:13:59,684
Edge of Darkness is a 2010 conspiracy crime thriller film directed by Martin Campbell, written
by William Monahan and Andrew Bovell, and starring Mel Gibson and Ray Winstone.

13
01:20:03,157 --> 01:20:09,157
A British-American co-production, it is based on the 1985 BBC television
series of the same name, which was likewise directed by Campbell.

14
01:26:12,631 --> 01:26:18,631
This was Gibson's first screen lead since Signs (2002), and follows a detective investigating the murder of
his activist daughter, while uncovering political conspiracies and cover-ups in the process.

15
01:32:22,105 --> 01:32:28,105
It was released on 29 January 2010.

16
01:38:31,578 --> 01:38:37,578
It received mixed reviews from critics, though Gibson's and Winstone's performances were praised, and
grossed $81 million against its $80 million production budget which made it a box-office bomb.

17
01:44:41,052 --> 01:44:47,052
The film explores themes of assassination, senator,
conspiracy theory, cover-up, murder.

18
01:50:50,526 --> 01:50:56,526
The tone is intense and mind_bending and dark.
